        "code": "<section class='cream-usecases'><div class='cream-usecases__inner'><div class='cream-usecases__head'><h2>業種ごとの売り方に、自然にフィットする。</h2></div><div class='cream-usecases__grid'><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/Hoodie.png?v=1782528525&amp;width=800' srcset='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/Hoodie.png?v=1782528525&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/Hoodie.png?v=1782528525&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/Hoodie.png?v=1782528525&amp;width=800 800w' sizes='(max-width: 599px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 999px) calc(50vw - 25px), 25vw' width='800' height='1200' alt='アパレルのShop the lookイメージ' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><h3>アパレル</h3><p>Shop the lookで、コーディネートから自然に商品詳細へ。</p></article><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/72fd8986095864800070d4a14b620617.png?v=1780990814&amp;width=800' srcset='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/72fd8986095864800070d4a14b620617.png?v=1780990814&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/72fd8986095864800070d4a14b620617.png?v=1780990814&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/72fd8986095864800070d4a14b620617.png?v=1780990814&amp;width=800 800w' sizes='(max-width: 599px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 999px) calc(50vw - 25px), 25vw' width='800' height='1200' alt='コスメ・美容のBefore and afterイメージ' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><h3>コスメ・美容</h3><p>Before & Afterで、使用前後の変化や魅力をわかりやすく伝える。</p></article><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/d314886a4225b31a081ec01c358051b8.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=800' srcset='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/d314886a4225b31a081ec01c358051b8.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/d314886a4225b31a081ec01c358051b8.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/d314886a4225b31a081ec01c358051b8.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=800 800w' sizes='(max-width: 599px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 999px) calc(50vw - 25px), 25vw' width='800' height='1200' alt='食品・D2Cの販促イメージ' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><h3>食品・D2C</h3><p>ストーリーやレビュー、定期購入の導線まで、一つのページでまとめて伝える。</p></article><article class='cream-usecases__card'><img src='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/3be2d760feaa5d936460a7d2e8807596.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=800' srcset='https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/3be2d760feaa5d936460a7d2e8807596.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=360 360w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/3be2d760feaa5d936460a7d2e8807596.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=600 600w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0704/2642/7614/files/3be2d760feaa5d936460a7d2e8807596.png?v=1780990815&amp;width=800 800w' sizes='(max-width: 599px) calc(100vw - 32px), (max-width: 999px) calc(50vw - 25px), 25vw' width='800' height='1200' alt='実店舗併設のMap導線イメージ' loading='lazy' decoding='async'><h3>実店舗併設</h3><p>店舗情報やお知らせを掲載し、来店とECをスムーズにつなげる。</p></article></div></div></section>",
